alarm|Device/sound, causative worry verb and fear noun remain distinct. Smoke sensor, pressure drop and bending branch contexts translate separately; no guarantee that the example alarm detects every hazard.
forth|Et-cetera meaning belongs to and so forth, not bare forth. Outward music example is literary but natural; both supported ordinals and phrase restrictions checked without inventing a new canonical idiom.
increase|Transitive rise in hours and noun growth in visitors align with their POS. Intransitive counterpart is not split artificially; by/to distinction is a useful magnitude note without actual numeric assumptions.
return|Travel back, noun return and giving an object back have separate supported ordinals. Village, choir and tool examples preserve destinations and timing; return home correctly lacks to.
trace|Evidence tracking, residual sign, tiny amount and copied outline each have their own ordinal, examples and Vietnamese. Paint trace is small presence not no paint; drawing action is not confused with an investigation.
